{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50735","headline":"登杭州龙兴寺三门楼 · 张祜","name":"登杭州龙兴寺三门楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十里江城下渺漫，两层门上倚栏干。\n偏宜竹翠山长润，早见梅花地少寒。\n沙觜渐平人改路，潮痕初静鸟移滩。\n高楼酒夜谁家笛，一曲《凉州》梦里残。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}